      "detailsHtml": "<p>Compact practical points based on the provided source text. Several typical items (formulations, dosing, and detailed overdosage instructions) were not present in the source; consult the full product labeling or packaging for those specifics.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Formulations/Strengths:</strong> Not specified in the provided source. Verify exact product strength and formulation on the label or full prescribing information before dosing.</li>\n  <li><strong>Storage & handling:</strong> Store at 20º to 25ºC (68º to 77ºF). Avoid high humidity and excessive heat above 40ºC (104ºF). Protect from light.</li>\n  <li><strong>Overdosage — first steps:</strong> Specific overdose management was not included in the source. In any suspected overdose, seek urgent medical evaluation per local emergency resources.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"medlens-callout dose\"><span class=\"medlens-callout-label\">Dose guidance</span><p>Dosing and titration details were not present in the provided text. Use the product’s full prescribing information or package directions for indication-specific dosing, maximum doses, renal adjustment, and administration notes.</p></div>\n<div class=\"medlens-callout patient\"><span class=\"medlens-callout-label\">Patient counseling</span><p>Advise patients to store the medicine as above, keep it in the original container, follow the package/label dosing exactly, report new or worsening symptoms, and seek prompt medical attention for suspected overdose.</p></div>",
