    "formulation": {
      "summaryHtml": "<p>&amp; STRENGTHS Tablets: 2.5 mg white to off white, round, flat, beveled edge tablets with ‘A 2’ debossed on one side and plain on other side.</p>",
      "detailsHtml": "<h4>Dosage Forms &amp; Strengths</h4><p>3 DOSAGE FORMS &amp; STRENGTHS Tablets: 2.5 mg white to off white, round, flat, beveled edge tablets with ‘A 2’ debossed on one side and plain on other side. Tablets: 5 mg white to off white, round, flat, beveled edge tablets with ‘A 5&#39; debossed on one side and plain on other side. Tablets: 10 mg white to off white, round, flat, beveled edge tablets with ‘A l 0’ debossed on one side and plain on other side. Tablets: 2.5 mg, 5 mg, and 10 mg ( 3 )</p><h4>How Supplied</h4><p>16 HOW SUPPLIED/STORAGE AND HANDLING 5 mg Tablets Amlodipine besylate tablets, USP 5 mg (amlodipine besylate equivalent to 5 mg of amlodipine per tablet) are white to off white, round, flat, beveled edge tablets with ‘A 5’ debossed on one side and plain on other side and supplied as follows: NDC 42708-204-30 Bottle of 30 Storage Store at 20° to 25°C (68° to 77°F), excursions permitted to 15° to 30°C (59° to 86°F) (see USP Controlled Room Temperature), and dispense in tight, light resistant container (USP). Manufactured by: Alkem Laboratories Ltd., Mumbai - 400 013, INDIA. Distributed by: Ascend Laboratories, LLC Bedminster, NJ 07921 Revised Date: February, 2025 For Patient Information, please visit: www.ascendlaboratories.com/pti/amlodipinetabs.pdf</p>"
    },
