      "summaryHtml": "<p>Labor and Delivery The effect of tetracyclines on labor and delivery is unknown.</p><p>Nursing Mothers Tetracyclines are excreted in human milk; however, the extent of absorption of tetracyclines, including doxycycline, by the breastfed infant is not known.</p>",
