      "detailsHtml": "<h4>Storage &amp; Handling</h4><p>Storage and Handling Store at 20° to 25°C (68° to 77°F) [See USP Controlled Room Temperature]. Protect from light and moisture. Dispense in a tight, light-resistant container as defined in the USP using a child-resistant closure.</p>"
