        "summaryHtml": "<p>Use of fluticasone propionate and salmeterol inhalation powder 100 mcg/50 mcg in patients aged 4 to 11 years is supported by extrapolation of efficacy data from older subjects and by safety and efficacy data from a trial of fluticasone propionate and...</p>",
