      "summaryHtml": "<ul><li>Furosemide tablets are contraindicated in patients with anuria and in patients with a history of hypersensitivity to furosemide.</li></ul>",
      "detailsHtml": "<h4>Contraindications</h4><p>CONTRAINDICATIONS Furosemide tablets are contraindicated in patients with anuria and in patients with a history of hypersensitivity to furosemide.</p>"
