      "detailsHtml": "<h4>How Supplied</h4><p>HOW SUPPLIED Prednisone Tablets USP 20 mg - White to off white color, circular, biconvex tablets debossed with &#39;P20&#39; on one side and break line on other side and free from physical defects. NDC: 70518-4293-00 NDC: 70518-4293-01 NDC: 70518-4293-02 NDC: 70518-4293-03 NDC: 70518-4293-04 NDC: 70518-4293-05 NDC: 70518-4293-06 NDC: 70518-4293-07 PACKAGING: 10 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 7 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 5 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 14 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 30 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 6 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 5 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC PACKAGING: 8 in 1 BOTTLE PLASTIC Store at 20° to 25 °C (68° to 77 °F); excursions permitted to 15° to 30 °C (59° to 86 °F) [see USP Controlled Room Temperature]. Dispense in a tight container, as defined in the USP/NF. PROTECT FROM MOISTURE. Rx only Repackaged and Distributed By: Remedy Repack, Inc. 625 Kolter Dr. Suite #4 Indiana, PA 1-724-465-8762</p>"
